  "progression_unit": "session",
  "dose": "sets",
  "days": 6,
  "notes": "Three nodes, push/pull/legs, cycle twice through a 6-session week. Main lift on each day is 5x5, adding load every session it is hit in full; once a session is missed twice in a row the lift falls back to reps-in-range work, expressed here as the closest single-tier fallback the format allows (advance_when.top_of_rep_range on the same block after a miss is not representable, so the miss just holds). Chin-up progresses by added rep, not added weight.",
  "rotation": [
    {
      "id": "PUSH",
      "label": "Push",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "label": "Bench",
